# "The exiled card" is the one this object's enters ability exiled (CR 607.2a), and a permanent that leaves and returns is a
# new object (CR 400.7). Bot1's Null Summoner exiles Bot2's Lightning Bolt and Bot1 mills itself to threshold with Brain
# Freeze. On turn three Ephemerate flickers the Summoner: the creature that returns was not cast, so its enters ability does
# not trigger (the intervening "if you cast it", CR 603.4 - the stack stays empty and Bot2 keeps its hand), and nothing was
# exiled with it, so with threshold and Island and Mox Sapphire open the Bolt can't be cast from exile. The twin where the
# Bolt is cast is "...casts-the-exiled-card-only-once-it-has-threshold-with-mana-of-any-type".

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Null Summoner
Brain Freeze
Ephemerate
Mox Pearl
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Shock
Mountain x20

